  "review": {
    "note": "Refreshed every direct build, runtime, development and Node dependency against PyPI/npm, including candidates beyond bounds, for the independent 0.45.2 logging-directory failure fix. Direct requirements are unchanged from primary 0.45.1. The freshly rebuilt repository-local environment normally resolved the same direct cohort as that primary audit: Zendriver 0.17.1, websockets 17.3, Ruff 0.17.1, mypy 2.4.0, pytest 9.1.1 and markdownlint-cli2 0.23.3. The full logging regression suite passed 87 tests covering normal logging, initialization failures, required and optional file sinks, redaction, retries and shutdown. Commit-time Ruff lint/format, strict mypy and Markdown checks passed without relaxed rules. Unchanged exact Zendriver and other dependency bounds retain the rationale reviewed for primary 0.45.1; the browser retirement changes are already independently reviewed and merged at cbf436b4bdeae8b08aab5ed106aa204da6d775b9. This receipt is dependency evidence only; exact-candidate code review, full gate and installed-wheel smoke remain separate required checks. Native Windows execution, live accounts and production deployment are not covered.",
